<title>INDIA: India's SEBI board to meet next week in Delhi.</title>
<headline>India's SEBI board to meet next week in Delhi.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of directors of the Securities and Exchange Board of India (SEBI) will meet in New Delhi on March 26, SEBI chairman D.R. Mehta said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Mehta told reporters after a business conference that the meeting was expected to discuss issues related to carry-forward trading of stocks. He did not elaborate.</p>
<p>--New Delhi newsroom, +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
